      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an officer;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an employee; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d__subpara_A",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d__subpara_B"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "an agent, of the employer, it shall be a defence for any employer prosecuted under subsection (1) if the employer proves—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the offence was committed without the knowledge, consent or connivance of the employer; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_48__subsec_2__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the employer has taken all reasonable precautions and exercised all due diligence to prevent the commission of the offence as the employer sought to have taken and exercised, having regard to the nature of the functions of the member of the board of directors, officer, employee or agent in that capacity and to all the circumstances. Offences by body corporate, etc."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "49",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If an employer who is a body corporate, partnership or society commits an offence under this Act—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a body corporate, any person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a partnership, every partner in the partnership at the time of the commission of the offence; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c__subpara_A",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c__subpara_B"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a society, every office-bearer of the society at the time of the commission of the offence, may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with the body corporate, partnership or society and if the body corporate, partnership or society is found to have committed the offence, shall be deemed to have committed that offence unless, having regard to the nature of his functions in that capacity and to all circumstances, he proves—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that the offence was committed without his knowledge, consent or connivance; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_49__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "that he had taken all reasonable precautions and exercised due diligence to prevent the commission of the offence. Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Director General or any member of the Council or committee or any enforcement officer in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by him in such capacity. Public servant"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General or any member of the Council or committee or any enforcement officer while discharging his duty or performing his functions or exercising his powers under this Act in such capacity shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Protection against suits and legal proceedings"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No action, suit, prosecution or any other proceeding shall lie or be brought, instituted or maintained in any court against—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Government;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Minister;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Director General;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any member of the Council or committee; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any person lawfully acting on behalf of the Council, in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by him or it in good faith, in such capacity. Protection of informers"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except as provided in subsections (2) and (3), no witness in any civil or criminal proceedings pursuant to this Act shall be obliged or permitted to disclose the name or address of any informer or the substance and nature of the information received from him or state any matter which might lead to his discovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If any book of account of wages, register, financial statement or other document which is in evidence or is liable to inspection in any civil or criminal proceedings whatsoever contains any entry in which any informer is named or described or which might lead to his discovery, the court shall cause all such entries to be concealed from view or to be obliterated in so far as may be necessary to protect the informer from discovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If in a trial for any offence under this Act the court, after full inquiry into the case, is of the opinion that the informer willfully made in his complaint a material statement which he knew or believed to be false or did not believe to be true, or if in any other proceedings the court is of the opinion that justice cannot be fully done between the parties in the proceeding without the discovery of the informer, the court may require the production of the original complaint, if in writing, and permit an inquiry and require full disclosure concerning the informer. Obligations of secrecy"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except for any of the purposes of this Act or for the purposes of any civil or criminal proceedings under any written law, or as approved by the Minister—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no member of the Council or committee, or officer of the Council, while he serves as chairman, member or officer, shall disclose any information which has been obtained by him in the course of his duties; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no other person who, by any means, has access to any information or documents relating to the affairs of the Council shall disclose such information or documents."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_54",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Prosecution"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No prosecution for an offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor. Compounding of offences"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Director General may, with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor, compound any offence committed by any person under this Act and prescribed to be a compoundable offence by making a written offer to the person suspected to have committed the offence to compound the offence upon payment to the Director General of an amount of money not exceeding fifty per centum of the amount of maximum fine for that offence within such time as may be specified in his written offer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An offer under subsection (1) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed but before any prosecution for it has been instituted, and if the amount specified in the offer is not paid within the time specified in the offer or such extended time as the Director General may grant, prosecution for the offence may be instituted at any time after that against the person to whom the offer was made."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where an offence has been compounded under subsection (1), no prosecution shall be instituted in respect of the offence against the person to whom the offer to compound was made, and any book of account of wages, register, financial statement or other document seized in connection with the offence may be released or forfeited by the Director General, subject to such terms and conditions as he thinks fit to impose in accordance with the conditions of the compound. Power to make regulations"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_57",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "57",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may make such regulations as may be necessary and expedient for the purpose of carrying into effect the provisions of this Act. Repeal and dissolution"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "58",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Wages Council Act 1947 [Act 195] (“the repealed Act”) is repealed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All wages councils established under the repealed Act are dissolved. Savings"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "59",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any wages council order made under the repealed Act shall continue in force until it is revoked or replaced by the minimum wages order made by the Minister under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All rules, regulations, orders, notices, forms, directions and letters of authorization made, issued or given under the repealed Act shall, in so far as the rules, regulations, orders, notices, forms, directions and letters of authorization are consistent with this Act, continue in force until it is revoked or replaced by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any inquiry, trial or proceedings done, taken or commenced under the repealed Act immediately before the commencement of this Act shall be continued and concluded under and in accordance with the provisions of the repealed Act. References"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_60",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "60",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All references to the repealed Act in any written law or document shall be construed as references to this Act. Things done in anticipation of the enactment of this Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI__cl_61",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All acts and things done by any person in preparation for or in anticipation of the enactment of this Act and any expenditure incurred in relation thereto shall be deemed to have been authorized under this Act, provided that the acts and things done are consistent with the general intention and purposes of this Act, and all rights and obligations acquired or incurred as a result of the doing of those acts or things, including any expenditure incurred in relation thereto, shall on the coming into operation of this Act be deemed to be the rights and obligations of the Council."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An employer who fails to pay the basic wages as specified in the minimum wages order to his employees commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not more than ten thousand ringgit for each employee. Court order"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the employer has been convicted of an offence under section 43, the court before which he is convicted may order the employer to pay—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the difference between the minimum wages rate as specified in the minimum wages order and the basic wages paid by the employer to the employee, including the outstanding differences; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "other payments accrued from the calculation of wages based on the basic wages which shall be in accordance with the minimum wages rates as specified in the minimum wages order."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The calculation of the differences and other payments accrued under subsection (1) shall be made in accordance with the Employment Act 1955, Sabah Labour Ordinance or Sarawak Labour Ordinance, as the case may be."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where an employer fails to comply with an order made under subsection (1), the court shall, on the application of the employee, issue a warrant to levy the employer’s property for the differences and other payments accrued under subsection (1) in the following manner:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by way of distress and sale of the employer’s property in accordance with the same procedure of execution under the Subordinate Courts Rules 1980 [P.U. (A) 328/80] and this execution shall apply mutatis mutandis notwithstanding the amount in the order; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_44__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the same manner as a fine as provided under section 283 of the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593]. General penalty"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_45",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "45",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who commits an offence under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit. Penalty in the case of a continuing offence"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person convicted of an offence under this Act shall, in the case of a continuing offence, be liable, in addition to any other penalty to which he is liable under this Act in respect of such offence, to a daily fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit for each day the offence continues after conviction. Penalty in the case of a repeated offence"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V__cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/17/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person convicted of an offence under this Act shall, in the case of a repeated offence, be liable to a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years."
      }
    }
  ]
}
